{
    "title": "S4U RC ONE - USA watch face",
    "description": "***\r\nIMPORTANT!\r\nThis is a Wear OS Watch Face app. Its supporting only smartwatch devices which are running with WEAR OS API 30+. For example: Samsung Galaxy Watch 4, Samsung Galaxy Watch 5, Samsung Galaxy Watch 6, Samsung Galaxy Watch 7 and some more.\r\n\r\nIf you have problems with the installation or download, even though you have a compatible smartwatch, open the supplied companion app and follow the instructions under Install/Problems. Alternatively, write me an e-mail to: wear@s4u-watches.com\r\n***\r\n\r\nThe \"S4U RC ONE - USA\" is a special Edition of the S4U RC ONE Collection. Its an realistic analog dial inspired by classic chronographs. The extraordinary 3D effect makes you feel like you are wearing a real watch. You can set up 7 custom shortcuts to get to your favorite app with just one click.\r\n\r\nHighlights:\r\n- realistic analog watch face\r\n- 7 individual shortcuts (reach your favorite app with just one click)\r\n\r\nDetailed summary:\r\n\r\nDisplay in the right area:\r\n+ Weekday\r\n+ Day of the month\r\n\r\nDisplay on bottom:\r\n+ analog Pedometer (max. 40k steps)\r\nExample: Arrow at 3 = 3000 steps\r\n\r\nDisplay at the left:\r\n+ Battery Status 0-100%\r\n\r\nDisplay on top:\r\n+ Heart Rate\r\n\r\n+ Have an minimal always on display.\r\n\r\nColor customization:\r\n1. Press and hold the watch display.\r\n2. Push the customize button.\r\n3. Swipe left or right to switch between the different customizable objects.\r\n4. Swipe up or down to change the options/color of the objects.\r\nOptions: Color (10), Shadow Border (3x) \r\n\r\nSetup the shortcuts:\r\n1. Press and hold the watch display.\r\n2. Push the customize button.\r\n3. Swipe from right to left until you reach the \"complications\".\r\n4. The 7 shortcuts are highlighted. Click on it to set what you want here.\r\n\r\nHeart rate measurement (Version 1.0.5):\r\nThe heart rate measurement has been changed. (Previously manual, now automatic). Set the measurement interval in the watch's health settings (Watch Setting > Health).\r\n\r\nIf you have problems, check whether you have activated the permissions on your watch.\r\n\r\n*************************\r\nCheck out my social media to be always up to date:\r\n\r\nWebsite: https://www.s4u-watches.com\r\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/matze_styles4you\r\nX (Twitter): https://x.com/MStyles4you\r\nFacebook: https://facebook.com/styles4you\r\nYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/c/styles4you-watches",
    "descriptionHTML": "***<br>IMPORTANT!<br>This is a Wear OS Watch Face app. Its supporting only smartwatch devices which are running with WEAR OS API 30+. For example: Samsung Galaxy Watch 4, Samsung Galaxy Watch 5, Samsung Galaxy Watch 6, Samsung Galaxy Watch 7 and some more.<br><br>If you have problems with the installation or download, even though you have a compatible smartwatch, open the supplied companion app and follow the instructions under Install/Problems. Alternatively, write me an e-mail to: wear@s4u-watches.com<br>***<br><br>The &quot;S4U RC ONE - USA&quot; is a special Edition of the S4U RC ONE Collection. Its an realistic analog dial inspired by classic chronographs. The extraordinary 3D effect makes you feel like you are wearing a real watch. You can set up 7 custom shortcuts to get to your favorite app with just one click.<br><br>Highlights:<br>- realistic analog watch face<br>- 7 individual shortcuts (reach your favorite app with just one click)<br><br>Detailed summary:<br><br>Display in the right area:<br>+ Weekday<br>+ Day of the month<br><br>Display on bottom:<br>+ analog Pedometer (max. 40k steps)<br>Example: Arrow at 3 = 3000 steps<br><br>Display at the left:<br>+ Battery Status 0-100%<br><br>Display on top:<br>+ Heart Rate<br><br>+ Have an minimal always on display.<br><br>Color customization:<br>1. Press and hold the watch display.<br>2. Push the customize button.<br>3. Swipe left or right to switch between the different customizable objects.<br>4. Swipe up or down to change the options/color of the objects.<br>Options: Color (10), Shadow Border (3x) <br><br>Setup the shortcuts:<br>1. Press and hold the watch display.<br>2. Push the customize button.<br>3. Swipe from right to left until you reach the &quot;complications&quot;.<br>4. The 7 shortcuts are highlighted. Click on it to set what you want here.<br><br>Heart rate measurement (Version 1.0.5):<br>The heart rate measurement has been changed. (Previously manual, now automatic). Set the measurement interval in the watch&#39;s health settings (Watch Setting &gt; Health).<br><br>If you have problems, check whether you have activated the permissions on your watch.<br><br>*************************<br>Check out my social media to be always up to date:<br><br>Website: https://www.s4u-watches.com<br>Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/matze_styles4you<br>X (Twitter): https://x.com/MStyles4you<br>Facebook: https://facebook.com/styles4you<br>YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/c/styles4you-watches",
